🏗️ Code Structure for Universal Engine Contract

```typescript
// src/core/EngineBase.ts
export abstract class EngineBase {
  abstract initialize(config: EngineConfig): Promise<void>;
  abstract validate(input: unknown): Promise<ValidationResult>;
  abstract execute(context: ExecutionContext): Promise<ExecutionResult>;
  abstract monitor(): Promise<HealthStatus>;
  abstract report(): Promise<Report>;
  abstract recover(error: Error): Promise<void>;
  abstract shutdown(): Promise<void>;
}
```

Every engine (QuestEngine, CommerceEngine, AIEngine, DeploymentEngine, etc.) will extend this base class, ensuring a consistent interface.

